tion $B(t)$ is *not* a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3.$ It assigns points in $\\mathbb R$ (not $\\mathbb R^3$) to vectors in $\\mathbb R^3$.\n\n- The function $C(x,y,z)$ is a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3.$ It assigns every point $(x,y,z)\\in\\mathbb R^3$ to a vector in $\\mathbb R^3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $A(x,y,z)=\\langle 2x, x^2, 1\\rangle$; $C(x,y,z)=\\langle 2x, x^2, 1\\rangle$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186546214 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89ad7ba9-81ac-553e-8ffe-37a112345fdc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546179} {:answer/id #uuid "fd521762-6972-57ec-95f0-1451ab5b98af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546230}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "89ad7ba9-81ac-553e-8ffe-37a112345fdc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546179} :answer-field/id #uuid "8c0fe7d5-e70f-5fd0-bf52-7f99dc2c2868" :answer-field/key "$C(x,y,z)=\\langle 2x, x^2, 1\\rangle$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546182} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "574d6fbb-c23f-5ba8-9ac2-6cbde1b780dc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546159} {:answer/id #uuid "6feafc39-2b77-5980-966f-9bfc3a31d279" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546168}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6feafc39-2b77-5980-966f-9bfc3a31d279" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546168} :answer-field/id #uuid "95ec8f76-2b4b-5fda-a746-6ac25299b3c3" :answer-field/key "$B(t)=\